Older releases
  Releases up to v0.2.1 included ue4ss/layouts: engine struct offsets and virtual
  function lists for two game builds, measured from a running copy of the game,
  plus UE4SS settings and two scripts that generated scan patterns from the
  operator's own copy. They held no game code or assets. They're in no release, tag
  or branch now. The commits that held them stay reachable by their hashes until
  GitHub purges them on request. Rights holders can ask through GitHub issues.

Leaflet (map page only)
  Project: https://leafletjs.com, License: BSD 2-Clause
  Not included here. web/map.html loads version 1.9.4 from unpkg.com, checked by
  its hash, into the viewer's browser.

Map backgrounds
  No map picture is included. map-background.example.json points at joric's
  Subnautica 2 tileset (https://github.com/joric/subnautica2_tileset, Unlicense),
  a community capture of the game loaded from joric's site by the viewer's browser.
  That licence covers joric's work and can't speak for the game's own rights.

SN2SlotFreeHost (this project's host mod)
  mod/SN2SlotFreeHost is this project's own Lua mod, written for the first
  working host on 2026-10-30. It is part of this repository and under its MIT
  licence (LICENSE); it has no upstream.
